/ Input: 3
/ Test 6: count down from the input to 1 (loop, Skipcond 000 and 800)
        Input
        Store N
Loop,   Load N
        Skipcond 800       / N > 0: keep going
        Jump Done
        Output
        Subt One
        Store N
        Skipcond 000       / never true here: N - 1 is not negative
        Jump Loop
        Output             / not reached
Done,   Halt
N,      Dec 0
One,    Dec 1
